,"speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"鯨井椛","textMapHash":1866982290,"text":"「海中月」…","nextNodeIds":[726590102]},{"nodeId":726590102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":158361490,"text":"「海中月」ってなに？","nextNodeIds":[726590103]},{"nodeId":726590103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"鯨井椛","textMapHash":3606061242,"text":"あっ、こんにちは！君がその…冒険者協会から来た釣り人なんだね？私は鯨井椛、稲妻の漁師よ。","nextNodeIds":[726590104]},{"nodeId":726590104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"鯨井椛","textMapHash":3292327842,"text":"すでに釣り協会から君のことについて聞いてるよ。今日会ってみて、若くて才能のある人だと分かった。やっぱり私は間違ってなかったわね。","nextNodeIds":[726590105]},{"nodeId":726590105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"鯨井椛","textMapHash":1137365594,"text":"私は近ごろ伝説の大魚を探してるの。「海中月」といって、伝説では、人々の願いを叶えることができるらしい。","nextNodeIds":[726590106]},{"nodeId":726590106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3250141570,"text":"えっ——願いを叶える大魚！オイラの好きな伝説の物語だ！","nextNodeIds":[726590107]},{"nodeId":726590107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"鯨井椛","textMapHash":1066108274,"text":"うん、みんなはただの物語だと思うかもしれないけど…私は本当のことだと思ってる。","nextNodeIds":[726590108]},{"nodeId":726590108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"鯨井椛","textMapHash":4094277298,"text":"なぜなら、何年か前、私は「海中月」に本当に遭遇したから…","nextNodeIds":[726590109]},{"nodeId":726590109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2036924834,"text":"じゃあ願いは叶った？","nextNodeIds":[726590110]},{"nodeId":726590110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"鯨井椛","textMapHash":151815370,"text":"まあ…そうと言ってもいいわね。詳しいことを説明すると…","nextNodeIds":[726590111]},{"nodeId":726590111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"鯨井椛","textMapHash":939943466,"text":"何年か前、それぞれの願望をもとに、私は嘉瑋とナンタックという二人の友達と一緒に海に出て、伝説の「海中月」を捕まえに行った。","nextNodeIds":[726590112]},{"nodeId":726590112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"鯨井椛","textMapHash":2919996298,"text":"だけどその旅路は順調なものじゃなく、私たちは雷雨に見舞われた。漁船はなんとか持ちこたえたけど、コンパスが完全に壊れて、私たちは未知の海域で遭難してしまったの。","nextNodeIds":[726590113]},{"nodeId":726590113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"鯨井椛","textMapHash":2051732890,"text":"何日か経っても、家に帰る方法を見つけられず、真水も底を突いた。みんな口には出さなかったけど、心の中では絶望しきっていたよ。","nextNodeIds":[726590114]},{"nodeId":726590114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"鯨井椛","textMapHash":4197775322,"text":"しかもある日の夜中、嘉瑋のやつ…こっそり遺書を書いて、漂流瓶に入れて海に投げようとしてた。","nextNodeIds":[726590115]},{"nodeId":726590115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"鯨井椛","textMapHash":77962154,"text":"彼は私たちがまだ寝ていなかったことを知らなかった。私たちがそれに気付いて、彼を止めたの。そしてその時、海面の下に巨大な影が現れた。","nextNodeIds":[726590116]},{"nodeId":726590116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"鯨井椛","textMapHash":2179913210,"text":"その影は淡い光を放ち、星のように輝いていたの。まるで、月を砕いて海に落としたかのようにね。","nextNodeIds":[726590117]},{"nodeId":726590117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"鯨井椛","textMapHash":2814810042,"text":"あれが「海中月」だったのかな？行き場のなかった私たちは、慌てて願ったよ。その場所から無事帰れますようにと。","nextNodeIds":[726590118]},{"nodeId":726590118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"鯨井椛","textMapHash":2296404746,"text":"そう、あとは君にも分かるわよね。私たちは生き残った。あの影は、まるで魔力があるかのように遠くへと泳ぎ、私たちはそれに続いた。それが、私たちの帰った道だったの。","nextNodeIds":[726590119]},{"nodeId":726590119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2650000946,"text":"わぁ——すごく感動できる伝説物語だな！","nextNodeIds":[726590120]},{"nodeId":726590120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"鯨井椛","textMapHash":2393175850,"text":"これは本当のことよ！私を信じて。私たちは必ずもう一度それを見つけるわ。","nextNodeIds":[726590121]},{"nodeId":726590121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3984999882,"text":"どうすればいい？","nextNodeIds":[726590122]},{"nodeId":726590122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"鯨井椛","textMapHash":828342250,"text":"まずは私の二人の旧友を訪ねるといいわ。彼らは経験豊富な漁師だから、彼らの手助けがあればだいぶ楽になるはず。","nextNodeIds":[726590123]},{"nodeId":726590123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"鯨井椛","textMapHash":887706746,"text":"<color=#00E1FFFF>嘉瑋は璃月港にいる</color>。その時帰ってからまだどこにも行ってないのは知ってるわ。彼もきっと「海中月」に会いたいと思ってるはずよ。","nextNodeIds":[726590124]},{"nodeId":726590124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"鯨井椛","textMapHash":2231977666,"text":"ナンタックはあれから海洋作家になったって聞いたわ。君たちが嘉瑋に会ったら、ナンタックがどこにいるか聞いてみて。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7265901,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["3200"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7265902,"order":2,"stepDescription":"璃月の漁師嘉瑋と会話する","stepDescTextMapHash":3325083116,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7265902,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["2615"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[7265902,7265903],"talks":[{"talkId":7265902,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["7265902","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7265902,"initDialog":726590201,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[2615,1005],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Daoqi_72659/Q7265902","priority":5,"questId":72659,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":726590201,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2615,"speakerName":"嘉瑋","textMapHash":78447010,"text":"海は美女と同じで、たまに会えればそれでいい…","nextNodeIds":[726590202]},{"nodeId":726590202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4146624258,"text":"#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYSECOND|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_GIRLSECOND]}が嘉瑋？","nextNodeIds":[726590203]},{"nodeId":726590203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2615,"speakerName":"嘉瑋","textMapHash":1438832234,"text":"ああ、何か用か？","nextNodeIds":[726590204]},{"nodeId":726590204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2615,"speakerName":"嘉瑋","textMapHash":2287322818,"text":"おお——「海中月」！「海中月」のことか！あの時の経験は、本当に印象深いものだった。","nextNodeIds":[726590205]},{"nodeId":726590205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2615,"speakerName":"嘉瑋","textMapHash":2727382922,"text":"鯨井のやつ、やっぱり忘れてなかったんだな。それもそのはず、あいつの願いは…うん！","nextNodeIds":[726590206]},{"nodeId":726590206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2615,"speakerName":"嘉瑋","textMapHash":1789056170,"text":"だったら、俺も君たちを精一杯祝福しよう。成功を祈ってる！","nextNodeIds":[726590207]},{"nodeId":726590207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2353008754,"text":"えっ？オイラたちはおまえを誘いに来たんだ。一緒に行かないのか？","nextNodeIds":[726590208]},{"nodeId":726590208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2615,"speakerName":"嘉瑋","textMapHash":470439450,"text":"はぁ、むかし海に出た時に、危うく命を失くしかけたんだ…海ってのはな、美女と同じで、たまに会うだけでいいんだよ…","nextNodeIds":[726590209]},{"nodeId":726590209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2615,"speakerName":"嘉瑋","textMapHash":1459321154,"text":"それに、もう家庭を持つ男として、家族を放っておくわけにはいかないだろ？夫としての責任を全うしないといけない！","nextNodeIds":[726590210]},{"nodeId":726590210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2615,"speakerName":"嘉瑋","textMapHash":3951715682,"text":"あれほど努力して、汗水たらして、やっと…あんな寛大で裕福な嫁と結婚できたんだ！だから、すまない…","nextNodeIds":[726590211]},{"nodeId":726590211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2682474954,"text":"旧友ががっかりすると思う。","nextNodeIds":[726590212]},{"nodeId":726590212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2615,"speakerName":"嘉瑋","textMapHash":3610303834,"text":"そんなこと言わないでくれ…そうだな…","nextNodeIds":[726590213]},{"nodeId":726590213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2615,"speakerName":"嘉瑋","textMapHash":469751426,"text":"俺は加入できないが、他の方法で君たちを手助けしよう。俺の釣り技術と経験をすべて君たちに授ける。","nextNodeIds":[726590214]},{"nodeId":726590214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2615,"speakerName":"嘉瑋","textMapHash":3646212666,"text":"「海中月」は伝説の生き物だ。簡単に釣れるもんじゃない。","nextNodeIds":[726590215]},{"nodeId":726590215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2615,"speakerName":"嘉瑋","textMapHash":1738655490,"text":"だから、俺の訓練を受け、俺の意志を引き継ぎ、神秘的な大魚を追ってくれ！","nextNodeIds":[726590216]},{"nodeId":726590216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2615,"speakerName":"嘉瑋","textMapHash":4221600994,"text":"そうだ、君たち、ナンタックを探してるんじゃないか？慌てなくても、あいつは冬眠中の老いたウミガメのように、ずっとモンドにいるよ。確か、本を書いてるって言っていた。","nextNodeIds":[726590217]},{"nodeId":726590217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2615,"speakerName":"嘉瑋","textMapHash":1857419594,"text":"だから今はまず、俺から繰り出される鬼の釣り訓練に集中するんだ！訓練が終わったあとに彼を訪ねればいい。","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7265903,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["7265902","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""